  "description": "Meet the completely redesigned WIRED Predator - our ultimate dual motor electric bike with UL2271 certified batteries, engineered for extreme performance and all-terrain domination.\n\nThe Predator features dual 72V batteries powering a geared 2000W rear hub motor and a geared 1500W front motor, delivering a massive 8000W peak power that conquers any terrain with ease.\n\n8000W Peak Power: Combined dual motor system for extreme performance\n\n330 N.m Combined Torque: 180Nm rear + 153Nm front = unstoppable climbing power\n\nPerfect For\n\nWhether you're tackling steep mountain trails, commuting through challenging terrain, or seeking the ultimate off-road adventure, the Predator delivers uncompromising power and performance with the safety assurance of UL2271 certified batteries. This is the bike for riders who demand the absolute best.\n\nWhat Makes It Special\n\nThe Predator's exclusive dual Hentach motor system provides superior torque distribution and traction control. With 330 N.m of combined torque and UL2271 certified batteries, this bike will conquer anything you throw at it - from steep inclines to loose terrain - with confidence and safety.",
